 "simulation", "physics", "funny", "gasstation"], "long_description": "\u26fd **Serve Customers & Fuel Cars**\n\n Earn honest cash for good service\u2026 or spill gas everywhere, overcharge customers, and see how much chaos you can get away with.\n\n\ud83e\uddfd **Clean, Repair & Upgrade Vehicles**\n\nClean dirty cars, repair broken parts and help customers leave happy. Good work means more cash and better reviews.\n{4346779738983128}\n\n\ud83d\udd28 **Break, Steal & Create Chaos**\n\nUse tools to damage cars, steal parts, mess with customers, and turn every visit into a ridiculous moment.\n{1652454625981589}\n\ud83d\ude9a **Unlock Tools From the Delivery Truck**\n\nEarn money and spend it on new tools, weapons, items, and upgrades. Each unlock gives you new ways to serve customers\u2026 or cause trouble.\n{1369139395178203}\n\n\n\ud83d\ude93 **Catch Wanted Fugitives**\n\nThe sheriff may ask for your help. Spot wanted drivers in the queue, stop them, and earn special rewards.\n\n\n{1209173294567966}", "short_description": "Serve cars or create chaos at a desert gas station.\nFill tanks, mess with customers, and see how far things can go."}]}, "developer_name": "Yorf Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://kalank.games/privacypolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Kalank Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://kalank.games/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTIN